 Demi Lovato live performances"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Ras Kimono is a Nigerian reggae artist whose debut album Under Pressure led by the single "Rum-Bar Stylée" was a big hit in the Nigerian music scene in 1989.","title":"Ras Kimono"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Before he released his solo album, he was in a group called "The Jastix" along with Amos McRoy and Majek Fashek.","title":"Ras Kimono"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Cyndi Lauper
